Dataset 0.1.0-alpha.2026-n1.5

- Complete the three-way independent audit. Audits A, B and C all pass with no
  issues and are bound to candidate manifest SHA-256
  `098d76f034c9495bbb2767b7ec38804b821a8ba51595078a38d6b2d89569903e`.
  Owner signoff remains pending; this is not a publication approval.
- Raise the per-question source floor to nine independent stem groups and six
  independent joint stem+answer groups. Add a complete seven-image solution
  article for question 19 and retain only the verified questions 15 and 16
  from 我爱高考; every question now has at least six independent joint sources,
  and all 19 questions pass the strengthened gate.
- Add an independent WeChat article with the complete question-18 stem and a
  three-image solution. Its ellipse equation, page-literal line equation
  `x=(2√5/5)y−1`, and `4√3` minimum are all equivalent to the canonical answer,
  replacing the incomplete question-18 stem on 我爱高考 as the sixth joint
  source.
- Reject the China Education Online answer for question 11: the frozen page
  says `BC`, not the correct `BCD`. The canonical remains `BCD`; the source is
  retained as a visible rejected row and no longer counts as joint support.
- Reject the China Education Online solution for question 16 after confirming
  that it prints `cos A = √7/3` and `CE = √6`; the independently checked answers
  are `cos A = 1/3` and `CE = 3√5`. Remove the stale question-16 observation
  instead of silently treating the wrong source as support.
- Correct page-local source mappings exposed by audit A. GK100 continuation
  pages no longer count as stems, Netease and Zizzs pages now name only the
  questions visible on that page, and Book118 page 9 records the Q12
  continuation alongside Q13/Q14.
- Stop deriving source observations from the canonical answer. Joint and
  answer-only sources must carry an explicit observed value from the frozen
  source page; the builder fails when it is missing, is a backfill placeholder,
  or disagrees with the canonical answer. The visible excerpt may use the
  source's own wording, but it must match the stored source text and cannot be
  the canonical answer pasted back into the audit.
- Keep the normalized canonical answer and the source excerpt as separate fields
  so both checks remain meaningful, and show every stem-only, joint, answer-only
  and rejected source in the acceptance dashboard.
- Pin both source specs into every data package and verify their hashes, manifest
  coverage, provenance paths, page labels and observed answers at validation
  time. Add negative tests for page relabeling, deleted specs and replaced
  observations.
- Allow a rejected source to preserve a contextual sentence as its visible
  excerpt while keeping the normalized observed answer separate. This fixes the
  false rejection of the frozen China Education Online `（BC）；故选 B、C` row
  without weakening the required source transcription checks.
- Mark China Education Online's question 15 page as `mismatched_stem`: the page
  prints `AC` where the canonical stem says `AC1`, and its distance answer is
  also wrong. Preserve the frozen evidence for review without counting that
  source toward either the stem or joint-answer gate. Its rejected row now keeps
  the page's actual `AC` stem instead of backfilling the canonical `AC1` text.

Dataset 0.1.0-alpha.2026-n1.4

- Supersede the failed n1.3 candidate without reusing its version or manifest.
  n1.3 is not an acceptance candidate: three independent audits found page-range
  omissions, a fail-open excerpt check, long-image page overclaiming, and packet
  fallback contamination.
- Raise the source policy to eight independent stem groups and four independent
  joint stem+answer groups per question. Add China Education Online's seven-page
  answer gallery and the eleven-page public preview from Book118. Reject five
  reproducible wrong-answer rows from China Education Online instead of counting
  them as joint support.
- Make source evidence page-local: non-document images must cover exactly their
  own page, every frozen page names the question numbers it supports, and a
  question-page range must be fully backed by matching files.
- Require exact canonical stem and answer excerpts. Prefixes and free-text
  suffixes are no longer accepted. Rejected sources preserve the observed wrong
  answer and a written rejection reason.
- Use the question-bearing answer pages from 高考100 as stem evidence and remove
  its six-page long image. Merge the two China Education Online URLs into one
  independence group.
- Make a stale owner packet fall back to canonical data rows. Packet CSV content
  can no longer add ghost papers or change acceptance counts.
- Add `scripts/verify_source_urls.py` for live URL, redirect, content-type,
  byte-count and SHA-256 checks against the frozen evidence manifest.
- Regenerate package documentation from the active source policy and source
  registry rather than hard-coded n1.2 counts.

Dataset 0.1.0-alpha.2026-n1.2

