Dataset 0.1.0-alpha.2026-n1.1 / Engine 0.1.8

- Add a per-question dual-source contract for the 2026 National I mathematics
  candidate. Every catalogued question now needs at least two independent
  question-stem groups and two independent sources that contain both the matching
  stem and the answer. Answer-only pages are recorded separately and do not count
